00:19:19.270 --> 00:19:22.110
Beaver, I thought I told you to scram out of here.

00:19:22.810 --> 00:19:24.510
I can't. I gotta eat my cookies here.

00:19:26.010 --> 00:19:26.490
Why?

00:19:27.290 --> 00:19:28.490
So don't get crumbs all over.

