Dishes, why'd you hate to do that?

00:19:45.920 --> 00:19:47.800
Beaver, why don't you just be quiet, huh?

00:20:09.840 --> 00:20:10.740
Anybody want a cookie?

00:20:10.900 --> 00:20:12.040
No, thank you.

