Hey, Wally?

00:20:30.060 --> 00:20:30.720
Now what?

00:20:31.460 --> 00:20:33.060
Uh, that's a dry pile, isn't it?

00:20:33.700 --> 00:20:35.220
Yeah, that's a dry pile.

00:20:35.380 --> 00:20:36.140
