00:20:37.860 --> 00:20:39.180
Well, that's a dry pile.

00:20:39.720 --> 00:20:41.600
How come you keep handing it back to Margie to watch?

00:20:44.230 --> 00:20:44.970
Thank you.

00:20:45.800 --> 00:20:47.660
