00:21:13.740 --> 00:21:15.280
They're still looking goofy at each other.

00:21:20.360 --> 00:21:22.800
All right, Ward. What do we do now?

00:21:24.660 --> 00:21:26.140
Now I take the cups to the kitchen.

00:21:45.990 --> 00:21:47.630
How's our kitchen romance progressing?

00:21:47.910 --> 00:21:49.950
Well, I sent Margie home early today

00:21:49.950 --> 00:21:51.390
before Wally got home from school.

00:21:52.230 --> 00:21:58.110
Mr. Howler, Wally's principal called up, and it seems that Wally got a C- on an English test.

