00:24:47.580 --> 00:24:48.660
Yeah, I guess so.

00:24:49.220 --> 00:24:50.460
Well, you know something, Wally?

00:24:50.960 --> 00:24:51.220
What?

00:24:52.380 --> 00:24:53.640
I'm sure glad they got over it.
